        "title": "Lumentree Local",
        "description": "Enter the inverter Device ID and the required read pairing token from the ESP32 local portal. The write pairing token is optional and only needed for direct inverter setting changes. Tokens are shown in uppercase for clarity, but they are not case-sensitive.",
